{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "88b545ce-c89f-433c-90c1-726f57d11042",
    "name": "Scénario : une journée au cinéma",
    "description": "Une histoire complète qui traverse les 4 services, dans l'ordre chronologique.\n\nLe matin, l'admin ajoute un nouveau film et le programme pour demain et après-demain. Camille découvre le site, crée son compte, se trompe de mot de passe, regarde les films et les séances, puis réserve. Plus tard, l'admin doit annuler une séance : la réservation de Camille est annulée automatiquement. Le lendemain, Camille le constate et supprime son compte. Pour finir, l'admin retire le film.\n\nChaque exécution crée son propre film et son propre compte : la collection peut être relancée autant de fois que voulu.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 - Admin : prépare le programme",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Se connecte",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const run = Date.now().toString(36);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"run\", run);",
                  "function ymd(d) { return d.toISOString().slice(0, 10).replace(/-/g, \"\"); }",
                  "const day = 86400000;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tomorrow\", ymd(new Date(Date.now() + day)));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"after_tomorrow\", ymd(new Date(Date.now() + 2 * day)));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"admin_token\", body.access_token);",
                  "pm.test(\"c'est bien un admin\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.token_type).to.eql(\"Bearer\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{user_url}}/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ajoute un nouveau film",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"no GraphQL error\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.errors, JSON.stringify(body.errors)).to.be.undefined;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"result of add_movie\", function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const r = body.data.add_movie;",
                  "    pm.expect(r.id).to.eql(\"dune-2-\" + pm.collectionVariables.get(\"run\"));",
                  "    pm.expect(r.status).to.eql(\"AVAILABLE\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{movie_url}}/graphql",
            "body": {
              "mode": "graphql",
              "graphql": {
                "query": "mutation { add_movie(_id: \"dune-2-{{run}}\", _title: \"Dune : Deuxième partie\", _director: \"Denis Villeneuve\", _rate: 8.5) { id title status } }",
                "variables": "{}"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Programme le film demain (en brouillon)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
